:"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of errors your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" may throw."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype UseBaseQueryResult<TData, TError> = QueryObserverResult<TData, TError>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-query/src/types.ts:304](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/types.ts#L304)\n\nThe result of `useQuery` when `initialData` isn't set — `data` may be `undefined` while the query is\n`pending`. Re-exports [QueryObserverResult](QueryObserverResult.md) from `@tanstack/query-core`. `useInfiniteQuery` returns\n[UseInfiniteQueryResult](UseInfiniteQueryResult.md) instead.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: UseBaseQueryResult\ntitle: UseBaseQueryResult\n---\n\n```ts\ntype UseBaseQueryResult<TData, TError> = QueryObserverResult<TData, TError>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-query/src/types.ts:304](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/react-query/src/types.ts#L304)\n\nThe result of `useQuery` when `initialData` isn't set — `data` may be `undefined` while the query is\n`pending`. Re-exports [QueryObserverResult](QueryObserverResult.md) from `@tanstack/query-core`. `useInfiniteQuery` returns\n[UseInfiniteQueryResult](UseInfiniteQueryResult.md) instead.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n"}
